// 4x4 matrix membrane keypad (Parallax #27899 / Adafruit 3844).
// 16 momentary membrane switches wired in a 4x4 column/row matrix (C1..C4 on pins 1..4,
// R1..R4 on pins 5..8 left-to-right with the ribbon at the bottom, per Parallax #27899 v1.2 p2
// and the Adafruit 3844 learn pinout figure) on a 1x8 2.54 mm header. No series diodes:
// holding three keys at three corners of a rectangle ghosts the fourth corner, as on a real matrix.
// Press keys from the CLI as `@<id>.k1` .. `@<id>.k9`, `@<id>.k0`, `@<id>.ka` .. `@<id>.kd`,
// `@<id>.kstar` and `@<id>.khash`, or click any key cap in the 3D viewer.
